                    <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                        <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong> reserves the right to modify, add, or delete parts of these T&C at any time, at its sole discretion. It is your responsibility to regularly review these T&C for any changes. Your continued use of the site after the publication of modifications signifies your acceptance of them.
